{"tmdb":1391021,"tagline":"Eat well, stay alive.","synopsis":"Seeking a fresh start, chef Xu Fu travels to the Middle East to support his family and repay his debts. Alongside restaurant manager Ma Junsheng, he transforms the struggling Dragon Restaurant into a thriving business. But when war engulfs the city, their hard-won success is shattered and the restaurant becomes a refuge for those caught in the conflict. As danger closes in, Xu Fu must risk everything to protect his newfound community and preserve a small beacon of hope amid the devastation.","directors":[{"name":"Wen Muye","id":1958907}],"cast":[{"actor":"Shen Teng","role":"Xu Fu","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/h9l1fHqty8EdCqDWNWjO5tp48xZ.jpg","tmdb":1519026},{"actor":"Jiang Qiming","role":"Ma Junsheng","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6OWIhJwjwiMWKBHcUTn7pglXEFx.jpg","tmdb":3863054},{"actor":"Omar Sherif","role":"Seif","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/iSiOazDKO0tIChVnn79oJJGYTHp.jpg","tmdb":3361500},{"actor":"Aarif Rahman","role":"Tony","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xIhutO65mdNEWKHusfvHZYTDITE.jpg","tmdb":148881},{"actor":"Sherif Sabry","role":"Zayd","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/bZMu6rlkJZpowmJVI4jrEEaFlPv.jpg","tmdb":6397550},{"actor":"Ahmed Salim","role":"Ali","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/kTelqFGKE4sOTJv4c1UNLSdAFxh.jpg","tmdb":6397555},{"actor":"Faruk Muhammad","role":"Jamal","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/y0cCsjFvtraHnwCAsaTl9sBXPZT.jpg","tmdb":4481139},{"actor":"Russell Shealy","role":"Morgan","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/i5Dsun5rSHEMycSarzNenKAtapu.jpg","tmdb":2979283},{"actor":"Naira Al-Kasim","role":"Lina","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5TLstny2iZYTAMiw9Srcl6Euh8R.jpg","tmdb":6397569},{"actor":"Karma Hazim","role":"Susu","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/w5AMweXu8IYVTZn5mTcxAEuh2AC.jpg","tmdb":6397559},{"actor":"Wei Qing","role":"Xu's Mother","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/on1BVc4NJwK03fT